{"id":"petrified-lizard","name":{"en":"Petrified Lizard","ja":"石化トカゲ"},"desc":{"en":"The fossil of a lizard. Looking at the fossil, it is clear lizards have looked basically the same for a very long time.","ja":"トカゲの化石。この化石を見ると、トカゲは かなり昔から今の形状をしていたことが分か る、年代が古いものほど、形がしっかりして いるものほど資料的価値が高い。"},"level":7,"locations":[{"id":"arland-wastelands","name":{"en":"Arland Wastelands","ja":"アーランド東の荒野"}},{"id":"outer-islets","name":{"en":"Outer Islets","ja":"外海諸島群"}},{"id":"scorched-wasteland","name":{"en":"Scorched Wasteland","ja":"灼熱の荒野"},"parent":"arland-wastelands"}],"traits":{"id":"petrified-meat","name":{"en":"Petrified Meat","ja":"石化した肉"}},"categories":[{"id":"meat","name":{"en":"(Meat)","ja":"（食材・肉）"},"icon":"totori-category-meat"},{"id":"ore","name":{"en":"(Ore)","ja":"（鉱石類）"},"icon":"totori-category-ore"},{"id":"poison","name":{"en":"(Poison)","ja":"（毒の材料）"},"icon":"totori-category-poison"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":75}